---
import SiteShell from "../components/SiteShell.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---

<SiteShell title="Privacy Policy" description="How Simple Sketchpad handles your data.">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    Last updated: September 2026. This policy explains what data Simple Sketchpad ("we", "us") may
    handle when you use this website.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">The short version</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    We do not collect, store, or sell your personal information. Your drawings live in your own
    browser and never leave your device.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">What we store — and where</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    Simple Sketchpad is a client-side application. When you draw, the app saves your work to your
    browser's <strong class="font-medium text-ink">local storage</strong> so your drawing is restored
    the next time you visit. This data:
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    <li>is stored only on your device;</li>
    <li>can be cleared at any time with your browser's "clear site data" tools;</li>
    <li>is never transmitted to any server.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">What we do not do</h2>
  <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">No accounts.</strong> There is nothing to sign up for and no profile is created.</li>
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">No tracking.</strong> We do not use analytics, advertising, or fingerprinting scripts.</li>
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">No third-party data sharing.</strong> We do not share data with anyone because we do not collect it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    This site does not set tracking cookies. Browsers may use local storage for the autosave feature
    described above; this is not a cookie and does not leave your device.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    If we change this policy, the updated version will be posted on this page with a new "last
    updated" date.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    Questions about this policy? Reach us at
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-primary">{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</SiteShell>